<title>USA: Walden buys three apartment buildings.</title>
<headline>Walden buys three apartment buildings.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walden Residential Properties Inc said Wednesday it has purchased three apartment buildings for about $25 million.</p>
<p>The properties, all in the Dallas-Fort Worth area, comprise 728 units.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to spend about $1.4 million to renovate the properties.</p>
</text>
